### ============================================
### 11. PERFIS
### ============================================

### Criar Perfil (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/gisa-api/api/perfis
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "ADMIN",
  "permissoes": [
    {"idPermissao": 1},
    {"idPermissao": 2},
    {"idPermissao": 3}
  ]
}

### Listar Todos os Perfis (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/gisa-api/api/perfis

### Buscar Perfil por Nome (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/gisa-api/api/perfis/nome/ADMIN

